=====Usage notes=====
Although {{m|id|buku}}, {{m|id|kitab}}, and {{m|id|pustaka}} are translated as {{m|en|book}}, they have different sense. The word {{m|id|kitab}} is used commonly in law and religion theme. The word {{m|id|pustaka}} is used commonly in literature.

